{"obsah":"<p>The start of the summer holidays was mainly about individual courses for older enduro riders and young guns, which Vlasta took charge of. On Saturday he and Martin Šimůnek with a bunch of kids went training in Šimi's stomping ground (the beaches of Lake Mácha), where they crushed Martin's traditional spots, and then set off for the village of Vchynice, to the newly renovated village barn, which the locals have turned into a community centre.&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p>A beautiful place and luxurious weather were ideal for an exhibition of more than 30 minutes, where both the kids and Vlasta with Martin performed for the locals. We managed a few competitions, drops off the trailer, a jump onto a car and jumps over volunteers, and after the exhibition the kids could catch sweets falling on ribbons from a plane.</p>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-gallery has-nested-images columns-default is-cropped\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F07%2FIMG_3576.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F07%2FIMG_3576.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237726\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F07%2FIMG_3517.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F07%2FIMG_3517.webp?alt=media\" alt=\"\" class=\"wp-image-237728\"/></a></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-large\"><a href=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.app/o/wp-content%2Fuploads%2F2023%2F07%2FIMG_3531.webp?alt=media\"><img src=\"https://firebasestorage.googleapis.com/v0/b/bikeskills-web.firebasestorage.ap